{"seq":1,"slug":"share-incentive","title":"分享激励与拼团裂变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-feed-commerce/social-virality/share-incentive","wordCount":2411,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"分享激励与拼团裂变\">分享激励与拼团裂变</h1><p>算法分发是&quot;平台把人带到内容前&quot;，社交分发是&quot;人把人带到内容前&quot;。后者的单位成本更低、信任度更高，代价是它必须借助用户的社交动作才能发生——而用户不会无偿帮你传播。这一篇讲分享激励的设计、拼团模式的工程实现，以及一个所有裂变系统最终都要面对的约束：拉来的用户是不是真的留下来了。关系链本身如何参与排序在 <a href=\"social-graph-distribution\">社交关系链加权分发</a> 里讲，如何防止激励被刷在 <a href=\"viral-abuse-guard\">裂变防刷与诱导分享合规</a> 里讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-裂变的经济学与用户价值测算\">核心概念：裂变的经济学与用户价值测算</h2><p>做分享激励之前必须先算清楚愿意为一个新用户付多少钱。这个数决定激励的力度上限，超过它就是在亏损买量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><msub><mtext>ARPU</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>retention</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>redeem</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LTV = \\sum_{t=0}^{T} \\frac{\\text{ARPU}_t \\cdot \\text{retention}_t}{(1+d)^t}, \\qquad \\text{CAC}_{\\max} = LTV \\cdot m - c_{\\text{redeem}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ARPU</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">retention</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">redeem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是可接受的 LTV/CAC 比值（零售电商常在 3 到 5 之间），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>redeem</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{redeem}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">redeem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是激励的履约成本（不只是奖励的面值，还包括发券带来的折扣损失、实物奖品的物流成本、以及风控成本）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ARPU</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ARPU}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ARPU</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>retention</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{retention}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8179em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">retention</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都必须按<strong>拉新渠道分层估计</strong>——裂变来的用户与投放来的用户在留存曲线上的形状显著不同，用全局均值会系统性高估裂变用户的 LTV。</p>\n<p>一个必须做对的细节是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>retention</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{retention}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8179em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">retention</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 要用<strong>该渠道自己的留存曲线</strong>，而且要多看几个周期。裂变用户的常见形态是次日留存低、但 30 日之后的留存反而比投放用户高（因为社交关系提供了额外的回访理由）。如果只看次日留存，会得出&quot;裂变用户质量差&quot;的错误结论并砍掉一个实际上健康的渠道。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[定义拉新目标与预算] --&gt; B[选择裂变模式]&#10;  B --&gt; C[设计激励结构与触发点]&#10;  C --&gt; D[实现奖励发放与风控]&#10;  D --&gt; E[小流量验证: 拉新数/留存/成本]&#10;  E --&gt; F{边际 CAC 是否低于上限?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[放量 + 监控留存曲线]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[调整激励结构或触发点]&#10;  H --&gt; E&#10;  G --&gt; I[持续监控: 留存衰减/作弊率/成本漂移]&#10;  I --&gt;|异常| H\">flowchart TD\n  A[定义拉新目标与预算] --&gt; B[选择裂变模式]\n  B --&gt; C[设计激励结构与触发点]\n  C --&gt; D[实现奖励发放与风控]\n  D --&gt; E[小流量验证: 拉新数/留存/成本]\n  E --&gt; F{边际 CAC 是否低于上限?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[放量 + 监控留存曲线]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[调整激励结构或触发点]\n  H --&gt; E\n  G --&gt; I[持续监控: 留存衰减/作弊率/成本漂移]\n  I --&gt;|异常| H</pre><p>这张图里 <code>F</code> 的判定用<strong>边际 CAC</strong> 而不是平均 CAC，是一个容易被忽略但至关重要的区分。激励通常有阶梯（分享 1 人得 A、3 人得 B、10 人得 C），每一档的边际拉新成本不同，且边际效益递减。一个裂变活动平均 CAC 很健康，但最后一档的边际 CAC 已经超过 LTV 上限，此时正确的动作是砍掉最后一档而不是关停整个活动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"激励模式的选择与组合\">激励模式的选择与组合</h2><p>裂变模式的形态差异决定了适用场景、成本结构和风控难度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>成本结构</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>邀请返利</td>\n<td>老带新，双方各得奖励</td>\n<td>双向固定成本</td>\n<td>高客单、低决策频次品类</td>\n<td>互刷、虚假账号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拼团</td>\n<td>多人成团享折扣</td>\n<td>折扣让利 + 履约成本</td>\n<td>高频、低客单、标准化商品</td>\n<td>拼团失败退款体验、凑单水军</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>助力/砍价</td>\n<td>逐人助力递减福利</td>\n<td>递减让利（前几刀便宜）</td>\n<td>拉新量优先的活动</td>\n<td>助力欺诈、首刀陷阱投诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分享得券</td>\n<td>分享给券（领取者不限）</td>\n<td>券核销率决定实际成本</td>\n<td>内容传播而非严格拉新</td>\n<td>券滥用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集卡/任务</td>\n<td>完成多步任务解锁</td>\n<td>固定奖品成本</td>\n<td>培养习惯、提升活跃</td>\n<td>脚本刷任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>拼团是这几种里工程最复杂的一种</strong>，它的复杂不在奖励发放，而在状态管理。一个拼团实例的生命周期涉及：成团条件（人数、时限）、参与者状态（已支付待成团、已成团、超时未成团）、资金状态（预付款冻结、成团后扣款、未成团退款）、以及团与团之间的关系（同一商品不同团的合并、团长发起的推荐团）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; gathering: 团长开团&#10;  gathering --&gt; formed: 达到成团人数&#10;  gathering --&gt; expired: 超过时限未成团&#10;  formed --&gt; fulfilled: 商品发货/交付&#10;  expired --&gt; refunding: 全额退款&#10;  refunding --&gt; [*]&#10;  fulfilled --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; gathering: 团长开团\n  gathering --&gt; formed: 达到成团人数\n  gathering --&gt; expired: 超过时限未成团\n  formed --&gt; fulfilled: 商品发货/交付\n  expired --&gt; refunding: 全额退款\n  refunding --&gt; [*]\n  fulfilled --&gt; [*]</pre><p>这里最容易出事故的是 <code>gathering → expired</code> 这条边。用户的预期是&quot;没拼成会退钱&quot;，但系统在 <code>gathering</code> 期间已经占了用户的资金（或额度），如果退款是异步的、且在途时间很长，用户的体感是&quot;钱被吞了&quot;。退款必须走与支付同优先级的通道，并且要在退款发起时立刻给用户一个明确的状态提示。另一个细节是<strong>拼团人数与库存的关系</strong>：如果成团时才扣库存，会出现&quot;拼成了但没货&quot;的局面；如果在开团时锁库存，则大量未成的团会长时间占着库存。常见的折中是按团预占一部分，并在超时前提前释放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"激励的触发点设计\">激励的触发点设计</h2><p>同一个激励力度，放在不同触发点效果差别很大。触发点决定了&quot;用户什么时候被提醒做分享&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发点</th>\n<th>用户状态</th>\n<th>分享意愿</th>\n<th>适合的激励</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内容消费完成（看完/点赞后）</td>\n<td>情绪高峰</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>分享得券、内容裂变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下单完成后</td>\n<td>满意/期待</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>邀请返利、拼团邀请</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领取优惠券时</td>\n<td>有获得感</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>分享给好友共同使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览商品详情时</td>\n<td>犹豫</td>\n<td>低（除非价格吸引）</td>\n<td>拼团降价、助力砍价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收到商品后</td>\n<td>体验已验证</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>晒单返利、评价有礼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被动推送（无行为）</td>\n<td>无上下文</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>通常无效，不建议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;内容消费完成&quot;与&quot;下单完成后&quot;是两个价值最高的点位，因为此时用户的情绪处于高点，分享是自然的延续动作而不是被打断。把激励放在&quot;浏览详情时&quot;是常见的次优选择——它确实能转化犹豫用户，但对其他状态下的用户是一种打扰。</p>\n<p>一个被反复验证的原则是：<strong>分享的内容必须本身值得分享</strong>。让用户分享一条硬广，即使给钱也会带动负面情绪（&quot;为了几块钱发广告给朋友&quot;有社交成本）。反过来，让用户分享一条他自己觉得有趣或有用的内容，加上适度的激励，社交成本会低得多。这条原则直接决定了裂变应该主要发生在内容侧而不是商品侧——内容可以有趣，纯商品信息很难有趣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"留存校验-拉来的人算不算数\">留存校验：拉来的人算不算数</h2><p>裂变系统有一个稳定的失败模式：<strong>指标很好看，业务没有增长</strong>。原因是拉来的用户没有留存，他们的价值接近于零，成本却已经付了。校验机制必须内建在系统里而不是事后分析。</p>\n<p>三个必须同时看的指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>拉动率（k 因子）</strong>：每个老用户平均带来多少新用户，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = i \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 是人均邀请数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是邀请转化率（来源：k 因子的定义与&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 即指数增长、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 持平、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 衰减&quot;的阈值语义，见 Wikipedia &quot;K-factor (marketing)&quot;, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K-factor_(marketing)）。$k\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K-factor_(marketing)）。$k</a> &gt; 1<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>理论上自增长，但实际中</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">理论上自增长，但实际中</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">理论上自增长，但实际中</span></span></span></span></span>k &gt; 1$ 的活动往往伴随着极高的作弊率，需要和下一个指标一起看。</li>\n<li><strong>激励后的增量留存</strong>：不能只看&quot;被邀请用户的留存&quot;，因为其中一部分用户本来就会注册。要用<strong>对照实验</strong>（保留一小部分不投放激励的对照组）测出真实的增量，而不是总量。</li>\n<li><strong>激励成本 / 增量留存用户</strong>：这才是真正的单位获客成本，用它和投放渠道比才有意义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>还有一个更隐蔽的校验维度：<strong>被拉来用户的&quot;意图纯度&quot;</strong>。同样是通过分享进来的用户，从&quot;好友分享的感兴趣内容&quot;进来的与从&quot;为拿奖励点开链接&quot;进来的，后续行为差异极大。系统应该记录分享的<strong>上下文</strong>（分享的是哪条内容/哪个商品、分享者与被分享者的关系强度），并在拉新归因时保留这个维度。没有上下文的裂变归因，无法解释&quot;为什么这个月裂变用户质量下降了&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>做激励前必须算清 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>redeem</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CAC}_{\\max} = LTV \\cdot m - c_{\\text{redeem}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">redeem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LTV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 与留存都要按拉新渠道分层估计；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>redeem</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{redeem}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">redeem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 要含折扣损失、物流与风控成本，不只是奖励面值。</li>\n<li>裂变用户的留存曲线常有&quot;次日低、长期反而更高&quot;的形状，只看次日留存会错误地砍掉健康渠道。</li>\n<li>放量判定用<strong>边际 CAC</strong> 而非平均 CAC，阶梯激励里最后一档超限时应砍掉那一档而不是关停活动。</li>\n<li>五种裂变模式成本结构与风险各不同；拼团工程最复杂，状态机里 <code>gathering → expired</code> 的退款通道必须与支付同优先级，库存预占要在超时前主动释放。</li>\n<li>触发点决定效果：&quot;内容消费完成&quot;与&quot;下单完成&quot;是价值最高的两个点位；让用户分享硬广会带来社交成本，因此裂变应主要发生在内容侧而非商品侧。</li>\n<li>留存校验必须内建：同时看 k 因子、增量留存（用对照组剥离本来就会注册的用户）、激励成本/增量留存用户；并记录分享上下文以便解释质量漂移。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>激励让分享发生，而分享出去的内容进入好友的 feed 之后，这条关系链本身应该影响分发权重——这是 <a href=\"social-graph-distribution\">社交关系链加权分发</a> 的主题；而任何给钱的激励都会立刻招来刷量，防线见 <a href=\"viral-abuse-guard\">裂变防刷与诱导分享合规</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分享激励与拼团裂变","id":"分享激励与拼团裂变"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：裂变的经济学与用户价值测算","id":"核心概念-裂变的经济学与用户价值测算"},{"level":2,"text":"激励模式的选择与组合","id":"激励模式的选择与组合"},{"level":2,"text":"激励的触发点设计","id":"激励的触发点设计"},{"level":2,"text":"留存校验：拉来的人算不算数","id":"留存校验-拉来的人算不算数"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"新用户兴趣冷启动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-feed-commerce/feed-personalized-distribution/cold-start-interest"},"next":{"title":"社交关系链加权分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-feed-commerce/social-virality/social-graph-distribution"}}